sequenceDiagram
    participant D as Developer
    participant UI as React UI
    participant A as .NET + MAF Harness
    participant P as Policy gate
    participant W as Isolated workspace
    participant L as Selected LLM

    D->>UI: Describe coding task
    UI->>A: Start or resume session
    A->>L: Ask for plan and next action
    L-->>A: Read/search/test tool request
    A->>P: Check policy and approval requirement
    P-->>A: Allow, ask, or deny
    A->>W: Execute permitted action
    W-->>A: Code, diff, or test output
    A->>L: Feed back concise result
    loop Until task is complete or a limit is reached
        L-->>A: Next action or final response
    end
    A-->>UI: Stream progress, approvals, and result
    UI-->>D: Review diff and outcome
